<div class="tophead2">
    <div class="title cntr"><span class="color">Welcome to Lyonesse</span></div>
    <p>Kingdom of Lyonesse is a browser RPG about growing your hero through battles, quests, equipment, and cooperation. Use this guide to learn the main progression loop and find your way around the game.</p>
    <p>New here? Start the prologue, follow Elaine's introduction, and then meet Jack at the Tavern. The guided opening explains the basics; you can return to this page any time from the footer.</p>
</div>

<div class="tophead2">
    <div class="title cntr"><span class="color">Your First Steps</span></div>
    <ol>
        <li><b>Finish the introduction.</b> The opening story leads into a short tutorial. Choose your hero name and gender when prompted.</li>
        <li><b>Save your hero account.</b> Quick start creates a hero so you can begin immediately. Use the Save Game option to link it to an email and credentials so you can sign in again; the save page displays its current bonus.</li>
        <li><b>Claim daily rewards.</b> Visit Daily Rewards when available and keep a daily login streak for progressively better rewards.</li>
        <li><b>Explore safely.</b> Start in the Dark Forest, choose a monster you can handle, and use your abilities during combat. Victories grant experience, coins, a material, and a tournament point; a defeat still gives consolation experience and coins.</li>
        <li><b>Improve your hero.</b> Spend coins and gathered materials in the Market Square, equip better gear, train abilities, and check your Profile to see your stats and progress.</li>
    </ol>
</div>

<div class="tophead2">
    <div class="title cntr"><span class="color">Gameplay and Progression</span></div>
    <p><b>Level and experience:</b> Battles and other activities award experience. As you level up, keep improving your Power, Defense, and Health with equipment and abilities. Your current level, combat stats, experience bar, and energy timers appear in the game header.</p>
    <p><b>Dark Forest:</b> Hunt monsters across the available zones to earn experience, coins, tournament points, and crafting materials. Each monster shows its strength and the material it can drop. Forest energy is limited and replenishes over time; the Forest page shows your balance and the available refill option.</p>
    <p><b>Combat:</b> Forest fights run in rounds. Your hero and the monster exchange attacks automatically, while you can activate equipped abilities when they are ready. Abilities can deal damage, heal, or change combat stats. Choose your battle deck before entering the forest, and pay attention to cooldowns and your health.</p>
    <p><b>Story quests:</b> The Tavern continues the game's guided story with chapters and quests. Follow the character prompts and complete each step to advance.</p>
    <p><b>Daily activity:</b> Daily Quests track repeatable objectives and offer rewards when completed. They also provide keys for the Common and Rare Chests; each chest can be opened once per day after collecting enough keys.</p>
    <p><b>Player Arena:</b> Challenge an active hero within five levels of yours. A challenge waits for the other player to accept or decline; the sent challenge records your stats at the time it is made, while the accepting player's current stats are used. Arena battles are limited and the Arena page shows your remaining attempts.</p>
    <p><b>Royal Tournament:</b> Earn tournament points through activities such as quests and battles, then check the weekly standings and rewards. The Tournament page links to details of the rewards and reset schedule.</p>
    <p><b>Clans:</b> Join an existing clan or create one to take part in group progression. Clans provide bonuses to some rewards and members can work together against their clan's raid boss.</p>
    <p><b>Achievements:</b> Complete milestones to claim rewards and unlock hero titles. Visit Achievements to claim completed milestones and equip a title for your profile.</p>
</div>

<div class="tophead2">
    <div class="title cntr"><span class="color">Currencies, Materials, and Gear</span></div>
    <ul>
        <li><b>Coins</b> are the everyday currency for trading and upgrades. You can earn them through play and exchange Rubies for Coins.</li>
        <li><b>Rubies</b> are a premium currency used for selected purchases and energy refills. The Royal Treasury handles Ruby packs; purchases are optional.</li>
        <li><b>Crafting materials</b> are collected from forest monsters, quests, and chests, or can be traded with the Resource Merchant. Use them to craft equipment and runes.</li>
        <li><b>Equipment</b> fills eight gear slots. Compare items in your Backpack, equip upgrades, and use the Blacksmith to forge or strengthen eligible items. Matching sets can grant bonuses.</li>
        <li><b>Runes and abilities</b> add further customization. Socket runes through the Runesmith, and train and equip abilities through the Trainer and Abilities pages.</li>
    </ul>
</div>

<div class="tophead2">
    <div class="title cntr"><span class="color">What the Main Links Do</span></div>
    <p>Use the Town Square as your hub. The large Arena and Tavern buttons sit above the main activity links. On smaller screens the side menus may appear above or below the page content.</p>
    <ul>
        <li><a href="/index.php">Town Square / Town Hall</a> — return to the hub and open the main activities.</li>
        <li><a href="/lec.php">Dark Forest</a> — choose a zone and fight monsters for progression and materials.</li>
        <li><a href="/tavern.php">Tavern</a> — follow story chapters and quests.</li>
        <li><a href="/arena.php">Arena</a> — send or respond to player challenges and view recent results.</li>
        <li><a href="/task.php">Daily Quests</a> — track daily objectives, claim quest rewards, and open chests.</li>
        <li><a href="/daily.php">Daily Rewards</a> — claim the current login-streak reward.</li>
        <li><a href="/tour.php">Royal Tournament</a> — view the weekly standings and open the tournament guide.</li>
        <li><a href="/shop.php">Market Square</a> — visit the equipment merchant, Blacksmith, Runesmith, Master Trainer, or Resource Merchant.</li>
        <li><a href="/profile.php">Present Profile</a> — review your hero, attributes, masteries, streak, and character links.</li>
        <li><a href="/item.php">Your Equipment</a> and <a href="/bag.php">Backpack</a> — review equipped gear and manage items you carry.</li>
        <li><a href="/skill.php">Abilities</a> — train abilities and choose which ones to bring into battle.</li>
        <li><a href="/achievements.php">Achievements</a> — track milestones, claim rewards, and equip unlocked titles.</li>
        <li><a href="/clan.php">Clan Castle</a> — browse or manage your clan and contribute to its raid boss.</li>
        <li><a href="/top.php">Hall of Fame</a> — browse the heroes at the top of the leaderboards.</li>
        <li><a href="/gold.php">Ruby Exchange</a> — exchange Rubies for Coins. The displayed rate is 1 Ruby for 1,000 Coins.</li>
        <li><a href="/paywk.php">Buy Rubies</a> — view available Ruby packs and payment options.</li>
        <li><a href="/contacts.php">Mailbox</a> — see your contacts and conversations; open a hero's profile to send a message or manage friends.</li>
        <li><a href="/chat.php">Chat</a> — talk in the global chat, or use the clan channel when available.</li>
        <li><a href="/news.php">News</a> — read game announcements.</li>
        <li><a href="/online.php">Online</a> — see recently active heroes and NPCs, including the activity or uptime information shown in the list.</li>
        <li><a href="/avatar.php">Change Avatar</a> — choose your hero portrait.</li>
        <li><a href="/ref.php">Invite Friends</a> — open your referral information.</li>
        <li><a href="/settings.php">Settings</a> — manage available account and game preferences.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>The side menu provides quick links to your Profile, Equipment, Abilities, Achievements, Clan Castle, Daily Rewards, Ruby Exchange, and Town Hall. The small envelope opens your Mailbox, and the footer links to News, Chat, Online, this guide, and Settings.</p>
</div>

